# Source documents are NEVER tracked in git.
# Distribution to members happens via Google Drive (see docs/DRIVE-SETUP.md),
# never via this public repo. Even fund-level docs (which are technically
# already in the encrypted dashboard data) shouldn't be in clear text here.
# Deny-all, not an extension allowlist: an unlisted extension (a .zip of
# subscription documents, a .key, a .heic of a signed page) would otherwise
# land in a PUBLIC repo. Only README.md is tracked here.
docs/source/*
!docs/source/README.md

# Carries live state: figures, member payment identifiers, tax detail.
# Must never be tracked in this PUBLIC repo. See CLAUDE.md section 2.
HANDOFF.md
